WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:10.990
Open the Pages workspace and wait for the page tree to load.

2
00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.339
Click the add root page button to start a new site tree.

3
00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:16.155
The root page form asks for the key fields before anything is saved.

4
00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:20.432
Type a clear page title. The title helps editors recognize the new site tree.

5
00:00:20.432 --> 00:00:24.867
Enter the hostname where the root page should answer.

6
00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:28.192
Keep the page unpublished while you are still preparing content.

7
00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:31.757
For this walkthrough we cancel instead of creating demo content on the server.

8
00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:36.368
Use search to find existing pages before editing or adding more content.

9
00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:40.326
Refresh the page tree after changes or when collaborating with other editors.
